  "title": "Grilled Shrimp Salad with Sesame Ginger Vinaigrette",
  "description": "This grilled shrimp salad with sesame ginger vinaigrette recipe offers a mix of salad greens, veggies, and grilled shrimp in a ginger sesame dressing.",
